    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14153" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">discernĭcŭlum</span></b> ,
		i, n.
		id.. * <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The bodkin in a woman's head-dress, which parted the
				hair, a hair-bodkin</i>, Lucil. ap. <i><span class="en">Non.
				35, 31</span></i>; cf. <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, §
			129</span></i>.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>a difference</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">coloris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Gell. 17, 15, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ambros. Apol. Dav. Alt. 4,
		26</span></i>.</div>
